                    <h2 class="am-tajweed-heading">Learn the rules behind beautiful recitation</h2>
                    <p class="am-tajweed-lead">Tajweed is the science of reciting the Quran with correct pronunciation and articulation. It teaches where each Arabic letter is formed and how its qualities, elongations and pauses are observed.</p>
                    <p class="am-tajweed-copy">With guided practice, students learn to apply these principles while reading Quranic verses. This course builds a careful foundation first, then helps learners develop accuracy, fluency and confidence at a comfortable pace.</p>
                </div>
