                        <div class="col-md-4"><article class="am-tajweed-card am-tajweed-benefit"><span class="am-tajweed-number">02</span><h3>Better Recitation</h3><p>Improve fluency, rhythm and accuracy by applying Tajweed rules in regular reading.</p></article></div>
                        <div class="col-md-4"><article class="am-tajweed-card am-tajweed-benefit"><span class="am-tajweed-number">03</span><h3>Greater Confidence</h3><p>Build confidence through guided practice, personal correction and teacher feedback.</p></article></div>
